{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "兰华", "steam": "蘭華"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "兰华"}, "voice": {"chs": "rk0050", "steam": "rk0050", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "『——不过，从下周开始暂时就不开全校集会了。\\n　问理由就太不懂事了所以别问』", "steam": "‘──不过，下周开始暂时没有全校集会了喔。理由很不识趣所以大家不要问。’"}, "length": {"chs": 39, "steam": 36}, "similarity": 0.615}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "但这个惯例，似乎也只持续到今天。", "steam": "虽然是惯例，但暂时就到今天为止的样子。"}, "length": {"chs": 16, "steam": 19}, "similarity": 0.387}
